{"id":9138,"date":"2017-09-05T00:00:00","date_gmt":"2017-09-05T06:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkfirst.com\/resources\/webinar-terminating-employees-best-practices-and-red-flags-to-consider\/"},"modified":"2024-12-27T18:33:18","modified_gmt":"2024-12-27T23:33:18","slug":"webinar-terminating-employees-best-practices-and-red-flags-to-consider","status":"publish","type":"resources","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/webinar-terminating-employees-best-practices-and-red-flags-to-consider\/","title":{"rendered":"[Webinar] Terminating Employees: Best Practices and Red Flags to Consider"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"9138\" class=\"elementor elementor-9138\" data-elementor-post-type=\"resources\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-39717de7 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"39717de7\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-263eb475\" data-id=\"263eb475\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1cd7e48d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1cd7e48d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Rethink Behavioral Health invites you to participate in our\u00a0upcoming webinar,\u00a0<strong>Terminating Employees: Best Practices and Red Flags to Consider!<\/strong><\/p><p>It\u2019s always a stressful time for everyone when an employee is leaving the company. Besides worrying about how employees and clients will be affected, you need to ensure this process is compliant and legal.<\/p><p>Our guest presenter, John Engers, Compliance Counsel\/President of Filice Tri-Valley,\u00a0will be\u00a0<strong>discussing red flags to keep an eye out for when considering terminating an employee!<\/strong><\/p><p>This live webinar was held on Thursday, September 21, 2017 at 1pm EDT\/10am PDT.<\/p><p>Rethink Behavioral Health holds a monthly webinar series entitled Entrepreneurship in ABA.<\/p><p>This targeted set of presentations will focus on the business aspects of running an ABA provider group.<\/p><p>Whether you are just getting started, or in high growth mode, this series will offer insights and best practices for helping your business succeed.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"author":19,"featured_media":22761,"template":"","meta":{"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"","_seopress_titles_title":"Webinar: Terminating Employees: Best Practices & Red Flags","_seopress_titles_desc":"","_seopress_robots_index":"","om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_links_to":"","_links_to_target":""},"audience":[70],"resource-type":[72],"resource-topic":[69],"resource-tag":[],"class_list":["post-9138","resources","type-resources","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","audience-providers","resource-type-webinar","resource-topic-business"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/9138","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/resources"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/19"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbe